://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":10,"created_at":"2026-07-04T18:56:47Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T09:33:51Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T01:26:41Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: v4.7.stable.flathub [5b4e0cb0f]\n\n### System information\n\nKubuntu 26.04 LTS - Freedesktop SDK 25.08 (Flatpak runtime) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Mesa Intel(R) HD Graphics 5500 (BDW GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-5300U CPU @ 2.30GHz (4 threads) - 10.59 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt seems the \"Set as Main Scene\" feature (if I'm not mistaken, introduced in 4.7) has broken the \"Run Current Scene\" button (F6) and the \"Play this scene\" command in a scene tab's context menu.\nNow it's no longer running the current or selected scene. Godot can now ONLY run the main scene (the one highlighted in blue), no other.\n\nI can't believe this has gone unnoticed (I'd think F6 is something people do all the time); is it only happening on my machine or what??\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nWell, I've seen the issue when I did this:\n- Created a new project in 4.7, with 2 scenes\n- EDIT: Must also enable the `config/disable_project_settings_override=true` in project settings\n- Then set one as main scene by right-clicking it on the filesystem tab; it goes blue\n- Now going to the other scene tab and pressing F6 plays the one in blue, not the one I want. Which makes F5 and F6 do the same thing, so F6 is now useless.\n- Right-clicking a scene tab and going to \"Play this scene\" also doesn't work and plays the main scene instead.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.git